~ ryo_final_dialogue
Radio Control: Excellent work Ryo, the alien control signal has gone....
Radio Control: Earth is free again.
Ryo: It doesn't end here and you known it...
Ryo: If they came to our planet, it means there's more out there.
Radio Control: We know. But today... humanity reclaimed its home.
=> END

~ billy_final_dialogue
Radio Control: You did it, Billy... 
Radio Control: The invading forces are retreating. We won this war.
Billy: I knew they couldn't beat us...
Billy: But something tells me this was just the beginning.
Radio Control: It's likely. Prepare yourself...
Radio Control: Because the next enemy could be lurking from the stars.
=> END

~ kimi_final_dialogue
Radio Control: Kimi, you did it...
Radio Control: The remaining humans are being freed. The occupation is over.
Kimi: I'm glad... but I can't ignore what comes next.
Radio Control: You're right. The universe is vast… and we're not alone.
Kimi: Then I will continue fighting. For the Earth... and for whatever comes next.
=> END